# error: repair_error_location.grammar:21:16:
# error: NOPE is not a token the parser grammar uses
#
# An @repair line naming a token the grammar does not use is reported at
# the name, like every other generation error.
#
# Today: the error has no line and column (`repair_error_location.grammar:
# error: @repair: NOPE ...`). Found while documenting @repair.

@lexer
tokens
    ident
    eof
    err
[a-z]+                                      → ident
.                                           → err

@parser
@lang = "repair_error_location"
@repair
    holes      NOPE

top! = IDENT                                → (top 1)
